          "code": "DETERMINESOURCE",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774277243604",
          "id": "1774277485166",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774277485170_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "From the current user message {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} and refined text {{$context.$nodes.TEXT_REFINEMENT.$output}} you try to understand the source.\n\nPasted email/table rule:\n- If the message contains an asset retirement email/table with columns such as Asset Number, Book, Retirement Reason, and rows of asset identifiers, return NEW_TRANSACTIONS.\n- If the message says assets were sold, due for retirement, effective retirement reason, or provides Retirement Date/Book/Reason summary values for listed assets, return NEW_TRANSACTIONS.\n- Do not classify pasted asset lists as ASSET_CONTEXT_QUERY, ORA_REQUEST_AGENT, or ORA_INGESTION_AGENT just because the text says review the list.\n\nThe source can be below:\n1. ORA_INGESTION_AGENT - review pending transactions.\n2. ORA_REQUEST_AGENT - review self service retirement requests, review retirement requests, or show retirement requests.\n3. ERROR - review error transactions, review exceptions, show exception transactions, or show exceptions.\n4. NEW_TRANSACTIONS - if the user says retire assets, process these, process the asset, process the files, process the input, perform retirement transaction, or cost retirement. Also use NEW_TRANSACTIONS when the user provides actual Asset Number, Tag Number, or Serial Number values with a retirement action, for example Retire Assets with Asset Number ASSET 001.\nReturn source only."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"source\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Store Source"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775841348393"
          },
          "code": "SETSOURCE",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774277243604",
          "id": "1774277539779",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776264119722",
              "name": "RetirementDetailsConfirmationMessage",
              "scope": "JOB",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Do you want to proceed with the Retirements?"
            },
            {
              "id": "1774277588454",
