          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776844316107"
          },
          "code": "MESSAGE",
          "id": "1776067227089",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776067227095_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given:\n- Change Intent: {{$context.$nodes.CHANGEUPDATES.$output}}\n- Previous Draft Data, if this was a change to an existing review: {{$context.$variables.previousDraftRetirementTransactions.result}}\n- Initial Data, if this is the first review: {{$context.$nodes.RETIREMENTTRANSACTIONS.$output.result}}\n- Updated Data: {{$context.$variables.draftRetirementTransactions.result}}\n\nUse Previous Draft Data when it is present and non-empty; otherwise use Initial Data.\n\nIf Change Intent is missing, empty, or action is UNKNOWN, respond with:\nPlease take a moment to review the assets selected for retirement.\n\nOtherwise summarize what changed in one concise line. Verify against Updated Data before saying a value was applied.\n\nField labels:\n- dateRetired -> Retirement date\n- retirementReason -> Retirement reason\n- costRetired -> Cost retired\n- retirementConvention -> Convention code\n- proceedsofSale -> Proceeds of sale\n- costofRemoval -> Cost of removal\n- comments -> Comments\n\n\n\nMandatory validation rule for Retirement Convention updates:\n- If Change Intent contains updates.retirementConvention, treat the requested convention value as case-sensitive.\n- Before saying the update was applied, inspect Updated Data for the targeted row(s). Use rowNumbers, assetNumbers, or all-assets targeting from Change Intent when present.\n- A Retirement Convention update is successful only for rows where Updated Data.retirementConvention exactly equals the requested convention value.\n- If none of the targeted rows show the requested convention value, respond exactly in this style: \"Retirement convention to <requested value> was not applied because it is not valid for the selected asset book.\"\n- If only some targeted rows show the requested convention value, say it was applied to the matching row(s) and not applied to the remaining row(s) because it is not valid for those asset books.\n- Do not include \"Updated successfully\" when no targeted row was updated.\n- Never infer success from Change Intent alone; the final Updated Data is the source of truth.\n\nRules:\n- Preserve asset identifiers exactly.\n- For successful updates, say \"<Field> is now <value>\".\n- For changes that did not apply, say \"<Field> to <value>\" and include a short failure reason.\n- For DEFER, say the matching assets were removed from this processing set.\n- For FILTER, say the review is now limited to the matching assets.\n- If one or more changes were applied, include this phrase once at the end: Updated successfully.\n- Keep the tone conversational and supportive.\n- Return a single line only."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Build Next Steps"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774286023604"
          },
          "code": "NEXTSTEPS",
          "id": "1776844316107",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776844316108_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given the Updated Data: {{$context.$nodes.DRAFTRETIREMENTSDATA.$output.pendingRetirements}}\n\nTask:\nCheck whether each asset includes required Retirement Date and Retirement Convention details.\n\nRules:\n- Always identify assets by Asset Number.\n- Mark Retirement Date or Retirement Convention as missing only when the field is truly null, empty, or absent.\n- If any asset is missing details, tell the user exactly what is missing and ask them to reply with the missing details or any other change.\n- If all assets have both required details, respond exactly in this style:\nAll the assets have the required details. Reply with \"proceed\" to post the retirement transactions, or describe any changes you want to make.\n\nOutput:\n- Return one single-line conversational message.\n- Do not mention approval buttons or clicking."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Build Txn Table",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "var data = $context.$nodes.DRAFTRETIREMENTSDATA.$output;\nvar rows = (data && data.pendingRetirements) ? data.pendingRetirements : [];\nvar source = $context.$variables.source;\nvar topMessage = $context.$nodes.MESSAGE.$output || \"\";\nvar bottomMessage = $context.$nodes.NEXTSTEPS.$output || \"\";\nvar userPreferencesResponse = $context.$nodes.GETUSERPREFERENCES.$output || {};\nvar userPref = (userPreferencesResponse.items && userPreferencesResponse.items.length > 0) ? userPreferencesResponse.items[0] : {};\nvar currencyResponse = $context.$nodes.PARSEUNIQUECURRENCYPRECISION.$output || {};\n\nvar dateFormat = userPref.DateFormat || \"MM/dd/yy\";\nvar decimalSeparator = userPref.DecimalSeparator || \".\";\nvar groupingSeparator = userPref.GroupingSeparator || \",\";\n\nvar heading = \"Asset Retirement Details\";\n\nif (source === \"ORA_REQUEST_AGENT\") {\n  heading = \"Retirement Request Details\";\n} else if (source === \"ORA_INGESTION_AGENT\") {\n  heading = \"Asset Retirement Transaction Details\";\n} else if (source === \"ERROR\") {\n  heading = \"Asset Retirement Exception Transaction Details\";\n}\n\nvar html = \"\";\n\nhtml += \"<div style='font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#2f2f2f; width:100%; overflow-x:auto;'>\";\n\nif (!rows || rows.length === 0) {\n  html += \"<div>No Pending Asset Retirement Transaction for review</div>\";\n  html += \"</div>\";\n  return html;\n}\n\nhtml += \"<table style='width:100%; max-width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; border:1px solid #e0e0e0; table-layout:fixed;'>\";\n\nhtml += \"<colgroup>\";\nhtml += \"<col style='width:4%;'>\";\nhtml += \"<col style='width:14%;'>\";\nhtml += \"<col style='width:16%;'>\";\nhtml += \"<col style='width:18%;'>\";\nhtml += \"<col style='width:12%;'>\";\nhtml += \"<col style='width:10%;'>\";\nhtml += \"<col style='width:12%;'>\";\nhtml += \"<col style='width:16%;'>\";\nhtml += \"</colgroup>\";\n\nhtml += \"<thead>\";\n\nhtml += \"<tr style='background:#f5f5f5;'>\";\nhtml += \"<th colspan='8' style='text-align:left; padding:10px; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;'>\";\nhtml += heading;\nhtml += \"</th>\";\nhtml += \"</tr>\";\n\nif (topMessage) {\n  html += \"<tr style='background:#f5f5f5;'>\";\n  html += \"<th colspan='8' style='text-align:left; padding:8px 10px; font-size:13px; font-weight:normal; color:#4a4a4a; border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;'>\";\n  html += topMessage;\n  html += \"</th>\";\n  html += \"</tr>\";\n}\n\nhtml += \"<tr style='background:#f5f5f5;'>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='padding:6px 8px; text-align:left;'>Row</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='padding:6px 8px; text-align:left;'>Book</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='padding:6px 8px; text-align:left;'>Asset Number</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='padding:6px 8px; text-align:left;'>Description</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='padding:6px 8px; text-align:left;'><span style='color:red;'>*</span> Retirement Date</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='padding:6px 8px; text-align:right;'><span style='color:red;'>*</span> Cost Retired</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='padding:6px 8px; text-align:left;'><span style='color:red;'>*</span> Convention</th>\";\nhtml += \"<th style='padding:6px 8px; text-align:left;'>Retirement Reason</th>\";\nhtml += \"</tr>\";\n\nhtml += \"</thead>\";\nhtml += \"<tbody>\";\n\nfor (var i = 0; i < rows.length; i++) {\n\n  var item = rows[i] || {};\n  var bgColor = (i % 2 === 0) ? \"#ffffff\" : \"#fafafa\";\n\n  var bookName = (item.bookName === null || item.bookName === undefined || item.bookName === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.bookName)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var rowCurrencyCodeRaw = item.currencyCode != null ? item.currencyCode : item.CurrencyCode;\n\n  var rowCurrencyCode = (rowCurrencyCodeRaw === null || rowCurrencyCodeRaw === undefined || rowCurrencyCodeRaw === \"\") ? \"\" : String(rowCurrencyCodeRaw)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var rowPrecision = 1;\n\n  if (currencyResponse.result && currencyResponse.result.length > 0) {\n\n    for (var p = 0; p < currencyResponse.result.length; p++) {\n\n      var cf = currencyResponse.result[p].currencyFormat || {};\n\n      if ((cf.CurrencyCode || \"\") === (item.currencyCode || item.CurrencyCode || \"\")) {\n\n        rowPrecision = Number(cf.Precision);\n\n        if (isNaN(rowPrecision)) {\n          rowPrecision = 1;\n        }\n\n        break;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  var bookDisplay = bookName;\n\n  if (rowCurrencyCode) {\n    bookDisplay = bookName ? (bookName + \" - \" + rowCurrencyCode) : rowCurrencyCode;\n  }\n\n  var assetNumber = (item.assetNumber === null || item.assetNumber === undefined || item.assetNumber === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.assetNumber)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var assetDescription = (item.assetDescription === null || item.assetDescription === undefined || item.assetDescription === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.assetDescription)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n   var dateRetired = \"\";\n\nif (item.dateRetired !== null && item.dateRetired !== undefined && item.dateRetired !== \"\") {\n  var d = new Date(item.dateRetired);\n\n  if (!isNaN(d.getTime())) {\n    var yyyy = String(d.getFullYear());\n    var yy = yyyy.slice(-2);\n\n    var M = String(d.getMonth() + 1);\n    var MM = M.padStart(2, \"0\");\n\n    var day = String(d.getDate());\n    var dd = day.padStart(2, \"0\");\n\n    dateRetired = dateFormat.replace(/yyyy|yy|MM|M|dd|d/g, function (token) {\n      return {\n        yyyy: yyyy,\n        yy: yy,\n        MM: MM,\n        M: M,\n        dd: dd,\n        d: day\n      }[token];\n    });\n\n  } else {\n    dateRetired = String(item.dateRetired)\n      .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n      .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n      .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n      .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n      .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n  }\n}\n\n  var costRetired = \"-\";\n\n  if (item.costRetired !== null && item.costRetired !== undefined && item.costRetired !== \"\") {\n\n    var n1 = Number(item.costRetired);\n\n    if (!isNaN(n1)) {\n\n      var fixed1 = n1.toFixed(rowPrecision);\n      var parts1 = fixed1.split(\".\");\n      var int1 = parts1[0];\n      var dec1 = parts1.length > 1 ? parts1[1] : \"\";\n      var sign1 = \"\";\n\n      if (int1.charAt(0) === \"-\") {\n        sign1 = \"-\";\n        int1 = int1.slice(1);\n      }\n\n      int1 = int1.replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, groupingSeparator);\n\n      costRetired = sign1 + int1 + (rowPrecision > 0 ? decimalSeparator + dec1 : \"\");\n\n    } else {\n\n      costRetired = String(item.costRetired)\n        .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n        .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n        .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n        .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n        .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n    }\n  }\n\n  var proceedsOfSale = \"-\";\n\n  if (item.proceedsofSale !== null && item.proceedsofSale !== undefined && item.proceedsofSale !== \"\") {\n\n    var n2 = Number(item.proceedsofSale);\n\n    if (!isNaN(n2)) {\n\n      var fixed2 = n2.toFixed(rowPrecision);\n      var parts2 = fixed2.split(\".\");\n      var int2 = parts2[0];\n      var dec2 = parts2.length > 1 ? parts2[1] : \"\";\n      var sign2 = \"\";\n\n      if (int2.charAt(0) === \"-\") {\n        sign2 = \"-\";\n        int2 = int2.slice(1);\n      }\n\n      int2 = int2.replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, groupingSeparator);\n\n      proceedsOfSale = sign2 + int2 + (rowPrecision > 0 ? decimalSeparator + dec2 : \"\");\n\n    } else {\n\n      proceedsOfSale = String(item.proceedsofSale)\n        .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n        .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n        .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n        .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n        .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n    }\n  }\n\n  var costOfRemoval = \"-\";\n\n  if (item.costofRemoval !== null && item.costofRemoval !== undefined && item.costofRemoval !== \"\") {\n\n    var n3 = Number(item.costofRemoval);\n\n    if (!isNaN(n3)) {\n\n      var fixed3 = n3.toFixed(rowPrecision);\n      var parts3 = fixed3.split(\".\");\n      var int3 = parts3[0];\n      var dec3 = parts3.length > 1 ? parts3[1] : \"\";\n      var sign3 = \"\";\n\n      if (int3.charAt(0) === \"-\") {\n        sign3 = \"-\";\n        int3 = int3.slice(1);\n      }\n\n      int3 = int3.replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, groupingSeparator);\n\n      costOfRemoval = sign3 + int3 + (rowPrecision > 0 ? decimalSeparator + dec3 : \"\");\n\n    } else {\n\n      costOfRemoval = String(item.costofRemoval)\n        .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n        .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n        .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n        .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n        .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n    }\n  }\n\n  var retirementReason = (item.retirementReason === null || item.retirementReason === undefined || item.retirementReason === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.retirementReason)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var retirementConvention = (item.retirementConvention === null || item.retirementConvention === undefined || item.retirementConvention === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.retirementConvention)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var tagNumber = (item.tagNumber != null ? item.tagNumber : \"\");\n  tagNumber = (tagNumber === null || tagNumber === undefined || tagNumber === \"\") ? \"\" : String(tagNumber)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var serialNumber = (item.serialNumber != null ? item.serialNumber : \"\");\n  serialNumber = (serialNumber === null || serialNumber === undefined || serialNumber === \"\") ? \"\" : String(serialNumber)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var createdBy = (item.createdBy === null || item.createdBy === undefined || item.createdBy === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.createdBy)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var creationDate = (item.creationDate === null || item.creationDate === undefined || item.creationDate === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.creationDate)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var comments = (item.transactionName === null || item.transactionName === undefined || item.transactionName === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.transactionName)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var requestId = (item.retirementInterfaceId === null || item.retirementInterfaceId === undefined || item.retirementInterfaceId === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.retirementInterfaceId)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  var errorMessage = (item.errorMessage === null || item.errorMessage === undefined || item.errorMessage === \"\") ? \"\" : String(item.errorMessage)\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n    .replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n\n  html += \"<tr style='background:\" + bgColor + \";'>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6;'>\";\n  html += (i + 1);\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n  html += bookDisplay;\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n  html += assetNumber;\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n  html += assetDescription;\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; white-space:nowrap;'>\";\n  html += dateRetired;\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; text-align:right; white-space:nowrap;'>\";\n  html += costRetired;\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n  html += retirementConvention;\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n  html += retirementReason;\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"</tr>\";\n\n  html += \"<tr style='background:#fcfcfc;'>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6;'></td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 10px; font-size:12px; border-left:3px solid #d6d6d6; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; vertical-align:top; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n  html += \"<div><b>Proceeds of Sale</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\" + proceedsOfSale + \"</div>\";\n  html += \"<div><b>Cost of Removal</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\" + costOfRemoval + \"</div>\";\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 10px; font-size:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; vertical-align:top; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n\n  if (source !== \"ORA_REQUEST_AGENT\") {\n    html += \"<div><b>Tag Number</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\" + tagNumber + \"</div>\";\n    html += \"<div><b>Serial Number</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\" + serialNumber + \"</div>\";\n  }\n\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 10px; font-size:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; vertical-align:top; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n\n  if (source !== \"NEW_TRANSACTIONS\") {\n    html += \"<div><b>Submitted By</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\" + createdBy + \"</div>\";\n    html += \"<div><b>Submission Date</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\" + creationDate + \"</div>\";\n  }\n\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 10px; font-size:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; vertical-align:top; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n  html += \"<div><b>Comments</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\" + comments + \"</div>\";\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 10px; font-size:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; vertical-align:top;'></td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 10px; font-size:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; vertical-align:top;'></td>\";\n\n  html += \"<td style='padding:6px 10px; font-size:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6; vertical-align:top; word-break:break-word; white-space:normal;'>\";\n\n  if (source === \"ORA_REQUEST_AGENT\") {\n    html += \"<div><b>Request ID</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\" + requestId + \"</div>\";\n  }\n\n  if (source === \"ERROR\") {\n    html += \"<div style='color:#d1242f; font-weight:600;'><b>Error</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;\" + errorMessage + \"</div>\";\n  }\n\n  html += \"</td>\";\n\n  html += \"</tr>\";\n\n  html += \"<tr><td colspan='8' style='height:1px; background:#f0f0f0;'></td></tr>\";\n}\n\nhtml += \"</tbody>\";\n\nif (bottomMessage) {\n\n  html += \"<tfoot>\";\n\n  html += \"<tr style='background:#f5f5f5;'>\";\n\n  html += \"<td colspan='8' style='padding:8px 10px; font-size:13px; font-weight:normal; color:#4a4a4a; border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0;'>\";\n\n  html += bottomMessage;\n\n  html += \"</td>\";\n  html += \"</tr>\";\n  html += \"</tfoot>\";\n}\n\nhtml += \"</table>\";\nhtml += \"</div>\";\n\nreturn html;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779100000002"
          },
          "code": "RETIREMENTDATAHTML",
          "id": "1774286023604",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Save Txn State",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var prior = $context.$variables.conversationRetirementFlowState || {};\nvar data = $context.$nodes.DRAFTRETIREMENTSDATA.$output || {};\nvar rows = Array.isArray(data.pendingRetirements) ? data.pendingRetirements : [];\nfunction text(v) { return v === null || v === undefined ? \"\" : String(v); }\nfunction asArray(v) { return Array.isArray(v) ? v : []; }\nfunction parseAny(v) {\n  if (typeof v !== \"string\") return v;\n  try { return JSON.parse(v); } catch (e1) {\n    try { return JSON.parse(JSON.parse(v)); } catch (e2) { return {}; }\n  }\n}\nfunction uniqueKey(parts) { return parts.join(\"||\"); }\nfunction collectRetirementReasons(src) {\n  var out = [];\n  var seen = {};\n  function addBook(bookObj) {\n    bookObj = bookObj || {};\n    var bookCode = text(bookObj.bookTypeCode || bookObj.BookTypeCode || bookObj.bookName || bookObj.Book || \"\").trim();\n    var reasons = asArray(bookObj.retirementReason || bookObj.retirementReasons || bookObj.reasons);\n    var rows = [];\n    for (var i = 0; i < reasons.length; i++) {\n      var r = reasons[i] || {};\n      var code = text(r.retirementReasonCode || r.code || r.lookupCode || r.X_LOOKUP_CODE || \"\").trim();\n      var meaning = text(r.retirementReasonMeaning || r.meaning || r.description || r.X_MEANING || \"\").trim();\n      if (!code && !meaning) continue;\n      var rowKey = uniqueKey([bookCode, code, meaning]);\n      if (seen[rowKey]) continue;\n      seen[rowKey] = true;\n      rows.push({ retirementReasonCode: code, retirementReasonMeaning: meaning });\n    }\n    if (rows.length > 0) out.push({ bookTypeCode: bookCode, retirementReason: rows });\n  }\n  function visit(v) {\n    v = parseAny(v);\n    if (!v) return;\n    if (Array.isArray(v)) { for (var i = 0; i < v.length; i++) visit(v[i]); return; }\n    if (v.result) visit(v.result);\n    if (Array.isArray(v.retirementReasonList)) { for (var j = 0; j < v.retirementReasonList.length; j++) addBook(v.retirementReasonList[j]); return; }\n    if (Array.isArray(v.retirementReason)) addBook(v);\n  }\n  visit(src);\n  return out;\n}\nfunction collectRetirementConventions(src) {\n  var out = [];\n  var seen = {};\n  function valueArray(v) {\n    if (Array.isArray(v)) return v;\n    if (v === null || v === undefined || v === \"\") return [];\n    if (typeof v === \"string\") {\n      var raw = v.trim();\n      if (!raw) return [];\n      if (/^[\\[{]/.test(raw)) {\n        try {\n          var parsed = JSON.parse(raw);\n          return Array.isArray(parsed) ? parsed : [parsed];\n        } catch (e) {}\n      }\n      return raw.split(\",\").map(function(x){ return x.trim(); }).filter(function(x){ return x !== \"\"; });\n    }\n    return [v];\n  }\n  function addConvValues(bookCode, code, id) {\n    code = text(code).trim();\n    id = text(id).trim();\n    bookCode = text(bookCode).trim();\n    if (!code && !id) return;\n    var rowKey = uniqueKey([bookCode, code, id]);\n    if (seen[rowKey]) return;\n    seen[rowKey] = true;\n    out.push({ bookTypeCode: bookCode, retirementConventionCode: code, retirementConventionId: id });\n  }\n  function addConv(v, inheritedBook) {\n    v = v || {};\n    var bookCode = text(v.bookTypeCode || v.BookTypeCode || inheritedBook || \"\").trim();\n    var codes = valueArray(v.retirementConventionCode || v.conventionCode || v.code || v.X_CONVENTION_TYPE_CODE || v.X_CONVENTION_TYPE_CODE_TBL);\n    var ids = valueArray(v.retirementConventionId || v.conventionId || v.id || v.X_CONVENTION_TYPE_ID || v.X_CONVENTION_TYPE_ID_TBL);\n    var max = Math.max(codes.length, ids.length);\n    for (var c = 0; c < max; c++) addConvValues(bookCode, codes[c], ids[c]);\n  }\n  function visit(v, inheritedBook) {\n    v = parseAny(v);\n    if (!v) return;\n    if (Array.isArray(v)) { for (var i = 0; i < v.length; i++) visit(v[i], inheritedBook); return; }\n    if (v.result !== undefined) visit(v.result, inheritedBook || v.bookTypeCode || v.BookTypeCode);\n    if (v.output !== undefined) visit(v.output, inheritedBook || v.bookTypeCode || v.BookTypeCode);\n    if (Array.isArray(v.retirementConvention)) { for (var j = 0; j < v.retirementConvention.length; j++) addConv(v.retirementConvention[j], inheritedBook || v.bookTypeCode || v.BookTypeCode); }\n    addConv(v, inheritedBook);\n  }\n  visit(src, \"\");\n  return out;\n}\nfunction activeBookList(rows) {\n  var seenBooks = {};\n  var books = [];\n  rows = asArray(rows);\n  for (var i = 0; i < rows.length; i++) {\n    var b = text(rows[i].bookTypeCode || rows[i].bookName || rows[i].BookTypeCode || \"\").trim();\n    if (b && !seenBooks[b]) { seenBooks[b] = true; books.push(b); }\n  }\n  return books;\n}\nfunction applySingleBookToConventions(conventions, books) {\n  conventions = asArray(conventions);\n  books = asArray(books);\n  if (books.length !== 1) return conventions;\n  for (var i = 0; i < conventions.length; i++) {\n    if (!text(conventions[i].bookTypeCode).trim()) conventions[i].bookTypeCode = books[0];\n  }\n  return conventions;\n}\nfunction applySingleBookToReasons(reasons, books) {\n  reasons = asArray(reasons);\n  books = asArray(books);\n  if (books.length !== 1) return reasons;\n  for (var i = 0; i < reasons.length; i++) {\n    if (!text(reasons[i].bookTypeCode).trim()) reasons[i].bookTypeCode = books[0];\n  }\n  return reasons;\n}\nfunction collectCurrencyPrecision() {\n  var src = {};\n  if ($context.$nodes.PARSEUNIQUECURRENCYPRECISION && $context.$nodes.PARSEUNIQUECURRENCYPRECISION.$output) src = $context.$nodes.PARSEUNIQUECURRENCYPRECISION.$output;\n  else if ($context.$nodes.PARSEUNIQUECURRENCYPRECISION_NEW_LANE && $context.$nodes.PARSEUNIQUECURRENCYPRECISION_NEW_LANE.$output) src = $context.$nodes.PARSEUNIQUECURRENCYPRECISION_NEW_LANE.$output;\n  var out = asArray(src && src.result !== undefined ? src.result : src);\n  if (out.length === 0) out = asArray(prior.currencyPrecision);\n  return out;\n}\nvar currencyPrecision = collectCurrencyPrecision();\nvar activeAssets = [];\nfor (var i = 0; i < rows.length; i++) {\n  var r = rows[i] || {};\n  activeAssets.push({\n    assetId: text(r.assetId),\n    retirementInterfaceId: text(r.retirementInterfaceId),\n    bookTypeCode: text(r.bookName || r.bookTypeCode),\n    bookName: text(r.bookName || r.bookTypeCode),\n    currencyCode: text(r.currencyCode || r.CurrencyCode),\n    assetNumber: text(r.assetNumber),\n    description: text(r.assetDescription || r.description),\n    tagNumber: text(r.tagNumber || r.TagNumber),\n    serialNumber: text(r.serialNumber),\n    costRetired: text(r.costRetired),\n    proceedsOfSale: text(r.proceedsofSale || r.proceedsOfSale),\n    costOfRemoval: text(r.costofRemoval || r.costOfRemoval),\n    retirementDate: text(r.dateRetired || r.retirementDate),\n    retirementReason: text(r.retirementReason || r.retirementTypeCode),\n    retirementTypeCode: text(r.retirementTypeCode),\n    retirementConvention: text(r.retirementConvention),\n    retirementConventionId: text(r.retirementConventionId),\n    transactionComments: text(r.transactionName || r.comments || r.transactionComments),\n    status: \"ready_for_posting_review\",\n    validationMessage: \"\"\n  });\n}\nvar availableRetirementReasons = collectRetirementReasons($context.$nodes.PARSERETIREMENTREASONLIST && $context.$nodes.PARSERETIREMENTREASONLIST.$output);\navailableRetirementReasons = applySingleBookToReasons(availableRetirementReasons, activeBookList(activeAssets.length ? activeAssets : rows));\nif (availableRetirementReasons.length === 0) availableRetirementReasons = asArray(prior.availableRetirementReasons);\nvar availableRetirementConventions = collectRetirementConventions($context.$nodes.PARSERETIREMENTCONVENTIONLIST && $context.$nodes.PARSERETIREMENTCONVENTIONLIST.$output);\navailableRetirementConventions = applySingleBookToConventions(availableRetirementConventions, activeBookList(activeAssets.length ? activeAssets : rows));\nif (availableRetirementConventions.length === 0) availableRetirementConventions = asArray(prior.availableRetirementConventions);\nvar events = asArray(prior.events).slice(0);\nevents.push({ action: \"transaction_review_ready\", stage: \"TRANSACTION_REVIEW\", assetCount: activeAssets.length });\nreturn {\n  schemaVersion: \"1.1\",\n  stage: \"TRANSACTION_REVIEW\",\n  source: text($context.$variables.source || \"DRAFT_RETIREMENT_TRANSACTIONS\"),\n  lastUserMessage: text($context.$system.$inputMessage),\n  activeAssets: activeAssets,\n  removedAssets: asArray(prior.removedAssets),\n  pendingRequest: prior.pendingRequest || {},\n  availableRetirementReasons: availableRetirementReasons,\n  availableRetirementConventions: availableRetirementConventions,\n  currencyPrecision: currencyPrecision,\n  draftTransactions: rows,\n  postResults: asArray(prior.postResults),\n  lastReviewHtml: text($context.$nodes.RETIREMENTDATAHTML.$output.result),\n  events: events\n};"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779000010004"
          },
          "code": "UPDATETRANSACTIONREVIEWSTATE",
